# ManageRoles ERP — Field Data Lineage & Cross-Page Relationships

> **Purpose**: For every input field on every page, this document traces **where the data comes from**, **how it is obtained** (typed, dropdown, AJAX, auto-generated, system-captured), and **which other page manages/creates that data**.

---

## How to Read This Document

Each field entry follows this format:

| Column | Meaning |
|---|---|
| **Field** | The input field name on the form |
| **Input Method** | How the user provides data: `Manual`, `Dropdown`, `AJAX Auto-fill`, `Auto-generated`, `System-captured`, `Calculated`, `File Upload` |
| **Data Source** | The SQL table/view the data comes from |
| **Managed On Page** | Which page in the system creates/manages the dropdown values |
| **Relationship** | How this field connects to other entities |

---

## Master Data Flow Diagram

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Most dropdown values flow through the **Reference Group System**. An admin creates a Reference Group (category) → then creates Reference Group Values (options) → SQL views (`qry*Master`) expose these as dropdown sources for other pages.

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    RGM["Reference Group Master Page\n(Creates categories)"] --> RGV["Reference Group Value Page\n(Creates dropdown options)"]
    RGV --> QRY["SQL Views\n(qry*Master)"]
    QRY --> DD["Dropdown Lists\non Master Pages"]
    
    QRY --> DEP["qryDepartmentMaster"]
    QRY --> DES["qryDesignationMaster"]
    QRY --> PRT["qryProcessTypeMaster"]
    QRY --> TMM["qryTeamMaster"]
    QRY --> MCM["qryMachineCategroyMaster"]
    QRY --> VDM["qryVendorMasterForDropDown"]
    QRY --> CTM["qryCompanyTypeMaster"]
    QRY --> CUM["qryCustomerTypeMaster"]
    QRY --> SUM["qrySupplierTypeMaster"]
    QRY --> CNM["qryContractMasterForDropdown"]
    QRY --> COM["qryCompanyMasterForDropdown"]
    
    DEP --> EMP["Employee Master"]
    DES --> EMP
    CNM --> EMP
    COM --> EMP
    CTM --> CMP["Company Master"]
    CUM --> CUS["Customer Master"]
    SUM --> SUP["Supplier Master"]
    MCM --> MAC["Machine Master"]
    VDM --> MAC
    PRT --> PRC["Process Master"]
    TMM --> PRC
```

---

## 1. Login Page — Field Data Lineage

| Field | Input Method | Data Source | Managed On Page | Relationship |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `Username` | **Manual** — User types | — | — | Matched against `Usermasters` table |
| `Password` | **Manual** — User types | — | — | Decrypted from `PasswordMaster` table via AES |
| `CAPTCHA` | **Manual** — User types | — | — | Server-generated via `CaptchaMvc` library |

**Data flow**: `Username` → looks up `Usermasters` table → matches `UserId` → fetches `PasswordMaster.Password` → decrypts via AES → compares → fetches `SavedAssignedRoles` (created on **Assign Role to User** page) → determines dashboard redirect.

