## 2. Registration Page — Field Data Lineage

| Field | Input Method | Data Source | Managed On Page | Relationship |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `UserName` | **Manual** + **AJAX duplicate check** | Checked against `Usermasters` table | **Create Users** page or self-register | AJAX: `GET /Registration/CheckUsername` |
| `FirstName` | **Manual** | — | — | Saved to `Usermasters.FirstName` |
| `LastName` | **Manual** | — | — | Saved to `Usermasters.LastName` |
| `EmailId` | **Manual** | — | — | Saved to `Usermasters.EmailId` |
| `MobileNo` | **Manual** | — | — | Saved to `Usermasters.MobileNo` |
| `Gender` | **Manual** | — | — | Saved to `Usermasters.Gender` |
| `Password` | **Manual** → **AES encrypted** | — | — | Saved to `PasswordMaster.Password` (encrypted) |
| `ConfirmPassword` | **Manual** | — | — | Client-side match validation only |

