## 6. Customer Master Page — Field Data Lineage

| Field | Input Method | Data Source | Managed On Page | Relationship |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `CustomerTypeId` | **Dropdown** | `CustomerTypeMaster` → `qryCustomerTypeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Customer Type" | Reference Group derived |
| `LM_Ledger_Name` | **Manual** + **AJAX duplicate** | — | — | AJAX: `CheckCustomerName` |
| `LM_Code` | **Manual** | — | — | Customer code |
| `LM_Address1–5` | **Manual** | — | — | 5 address line fields |
| `LM_Area` | **AJAX Autocomplete** | `LedgerMaster` → existing `LM_Area` values | **🔗 No UI page** — Pre-loaded master data | AJAX: `GET /CustomerMaster/GetCityName?term=` — searches `LedgerMaster.LM_Area` with `DISTINCT` |
| `LM_State` | **🔄 AJAX Autocomplete** | `StateMaster` → `ZZZZA_StateMaster` | **🔗 No UI page** — Pre-loaded master data | AJAX: `GET /CustomerMaster/GetStateName?term=` — returns `{label: StateName, value: StateCode}` (see §17.5) |
| `LM_StateCode` | **🔄 Auto-filled** from state | `StateMaster.StateCode` | — | When state selected from autocomplete → the `value` field carries the StateCode → auto-populates (see §17.5) |
| `LM_Country` | **AJAX Autocomplete** | `LedgerMaster` → existing `LM_Country` values | — | AJAX: `GET /CustomerMaster/GetCountryName?term=` — searches `LedgerMaster.LM_Country` with `DISTINCT` |
| `LM_PinCode` | **Manual** | — | — | 6-digit postal code |
| `LM_Contact_Person` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `LM_Phone_Number` | **Manual** | — | — | Phone |
| `LM_Cell_No` | **Manual** | — | — | Mobile |
| `LM_EmailID` | **Manual** | — | — | Email |
| `LM_WebSite` | **Manual** | — | — | URL |
| `LM_GSTIN` | **Manual** | — | — | 15-char GST ID |
| `LM_PAN_No` | **Manual** | — | — | PAN card |
| `LM_Aadhar_No` | **Manual** | — | — | Aadhaar number |
| `LM_Bank_Name` | **AJAX Autocomplete** | `LedgerMaster` → existing `LM_Bank_Name` values | **🔗 No UI page** — Pre-loaded | AJAX: `GET /CustomerMaster/GetBankName?term=` — searches `LedgerMaster.LM_Bank_Name` with `DISTINCT` |
| `LM_Branch` | **AJAX Autocomplete** | `LedgerMaster` → existing `LM_Branch` values | **🔗 No UI page** — Pre-loaded | AJAX: `GET /CustomerMaster/GetBranchName?term=` — searches `LedgerMaster.LM_Branch` with `DISTINCT` |
| `LM_Account_Name` | **Manual** | — | — | Account holder |
| `LM_Account_Number` | **Manual** | — | — | Account number |
| `LM_IFSC_Code` | **AJAX Autocomplete** | `LedgerMaster` → existing `LM_IFSC_Code` values | **🔗 No UI page** — Pre-loaded | AJAX: `GET /CustomerMaster/GetIFSCCode?term=` |
| `LM_MICRCODEBANK` | **AJAX Autocomplete** | `LedgerMaster` → existing `LM_MICRCODEBANK` values | **🔗 No UI page** — Pre-loaded | AJAX: `GET /CustomerMaster/GetMICRCode?term=` |
| `LM_Cus_Remarks` | **Manual** | — | — | Text area |
| _Audit: IPAddress_ | **🔄 System-captured** | `Request.UserHostAddress` | — | Auto from HTTP request (see §16) |
| _Audit: MACAddress_ | **🔄 System-captured** | `SystemInfo` table by IP | **🔗 System Info Master** (`/SystemInfoMaster`) | Lookup: `SystemInfo.Where(ip == requestIP)` (see §16) |
| _Audit: DeviceName_ | **🔄 System-captured** | `SystemInfo` table by IP | **🔗 System Info Master** | Same lookup |
| _Audit: Username_ | **🔄 System-captured** | `SystemInfo` table by IP | **🔗 System Info Master** | Same lookup |

> [!NOTE]
> **Supplier Master** follows the exact same pattern, just replacing `CustomerTypeMaster` with `SupplierTypeMaster` (group: "Supplier Type") and `LM_CusCode` with `LM_SupCode`.

