| `LM_Area` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | ← from selected customer | **🔗 Customer Master** | City from customer record |
| `LM_State` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | ← from selected customer | **🔗 Customer Master** | State from customer record |
| `LM_StateCode` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | ← from selected customer | **🔗 Customer Master** | GST state code |
| `LM_Country` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | ← from selected customer | **🔗 Customer Master** | Country |
| `Vehicle_Model_No_Id` | **Dropdown** | `VehicleModelNumberMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Vehicle Model Number" | Reference Group derived |
| `Model_Sub_Type_Id` | **Dropdown** | `VehicleSubTypeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Vehicle Sub Type" | Reference Group derived |
| `Vehicle_Name_Id` | **Dropdown** | `VehicleNameMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Vehicle Name" | Reference Group derived |
| `Serial_No` | **🔄 Auto-generated** via AJAX | SQL query on `VMAAqryVehicleMasterDetailsDisplaySplitSNoNumber` | Auto — no page | `GET /VehicleMaster/GetMaxSno?modelNo=` → MAX+1 filtered by financial year (see §17.3) |
| `Vehicle_No` | **Manual** | — | — | Registration plate |
| `Customer_Vehicle_Count` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | Count from `VehicleMaster` by customer | Auto — no page | `GET /VehicleMaster/GetVehicleCountDetails?customerId=` → `MAX(Customer_Vehicle_Count)` (see §17.4) |
| `BOM_Type` | **Manual** select | — | — | Static options |
| `Model_Row_Id` | **Dropdown** | `VehicleIndexModelNumberMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Vehicle Index Model Number" | BOM model link |
| `Remarks` | **Manual** | — | — | Text area |

