## 11. Item Master Page — Field Data Lineage (Most Complex)

| Field | Input Method | Data Source (SQL View) | Managed On Page | Relationship |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `GroupId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemGroupMaster` → `qryItemGroupMaster` | **🔗 Item Group Master page** (`/ItemGroupMaster/Create`) | Each group defines a prefix for part number auto-generation |
| `IM_Part_No` | **🔄 Auto-generated** | SQL function: `Z_GetMaximumPartNumberPlusOne1NEW1(@itemGroup)` | Auto — no page | Generated server-side on save from group name → next sequential part no. (see §17.2) |
| `Outsource_Part_No` | **🔄 Auto-generated** or **Manual** | SQL query: `SELECT TOP 1 MAXOSPN FROM qryItemMasterDisplayAllSplitOutSourcePNO2MAXSTATUS` | Auto or manual | Prefix "VOS" + auto-increment from MAX query (see §17.2) |
| `IM_PartName` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `ModelId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemModelMaster` → `qryItemModelMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Item Model" | Reference Group derived |
| `Brand` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `IM_Description` | **Manual** | — | — | Text area |
| `IM_Size` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `IM_WEIGHT` | **Manual** | — | — | Decimal input |
| `UnitId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemUnitMaster` → `qryItemUnitMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "UOM" | Reference Group derived (Nos, Kg, Mtr, etc.) |
| `IM_HSN_Code` | **Manual** | — | — | HSN/SAC code text |
| `IM_Purchase_Rate` | **Manual** | — | — | Decimal input |
| `IM_Margin_per` | **Manual** | — | — | Decimal input |
| `IM_Rate` | **Manual** or **🔄 Calculated** | — | — | Can be calculated: `Purchase_Rate × (1 + Margin/100)` |
| `CurrencyId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemCurrencyMaster` → `qryItemCurrencyMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Currency" | Reference Group derived (INR, USD, EUR, etc.) |
| `TaxId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemTaxGroupMaster` → `qryItemTaxGroupMaster` | **🔗 Tax Master page** (`/TaxMaster/Create`) | Shows tax % from Tax Master records |
| `SubGroupId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemSubGroupMaster` → `qryItemSubGroupMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Item Sub Group" | Reference Group derived |
| `StoreId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemStoreMaster` → `qryItemStoreMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Store" | Reference Group derived |
| `Rack_No` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `Location` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `IM_ReorderLevel` | **Manual** | — | — | Integer → used by **Auto PO** page for reorder alerts |
| `IM_Min_Stock` | **Manual** | — | — | Integer → used by **Auto PO** page |
| `ItemTypeId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemTypeMaster` → `qryItemTypeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Item Type" | Reference Group derived (Raw Material, Finished Good, etc.) |
| `QcTypeId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemQcTypeMaster` → `qryItemQcTypeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "QC Type" | Reference Group derived |
| `MaterialGradeId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemMaterialGradeMaster` → `qryItemMaterialGradeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Material Grade" | Reference Group derived (SS304, EN8, etc.) |
| `MaterialTypeId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemMaterialTypeMaster` → `qryItemMaterialTypeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Material Type" | Reference Group derived |
| `RawMaterialId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemRawMaterialMaster` → `qryItemRawMaterialMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Raw Material" | Reference Group derived |
| `RM_length` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `Raw_material_wt` | **Manual** | — | — | Decimal input |
| `FG_material_wt` | **Manual** | — | — | Decimal input |
| `ImageFile` | **File Upload** | — | — | Saved to `~/Content/images/` |
| `PdfFile` | **File Upload** | — | — | Saved to `~/Content/pdfs/` |
| `RouteCardNumber` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `IM_Remarks` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `PrefixId` | **Dropdown** | `ItemGroupMasterFormatedPrefix` | **🔗 Part Number Base Master page** | Prefix from part number config |

> [!IMPORTANT]
> Item Master has **12 dropdowns**, of which **10 come from Reference Group Values** and **2 come from dedicated master pages** (Tax Master and Item Group Master). When a new dropdown option is needed (e.g., a new UOM "Set"), an admin first creates it on the **Reference Group Value** page under the appropriate group.

