## 12. Quotation Page — Field Data Lineage

| Field | Input Method | Data Source | Managed On Page | Relationship |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `PO_No` | **🔄 Auto-generated** | C# server-side: Financial year prefix + padded sequence | Auto — no page | Format: `YY-YY/QXXXXX` (see §17.6 for exact formula) |
| `PODate` | **Manual** (default: today) | `DateTime.Today` | — | Date picker |
| `Customer_ID` | **Dropdown** | `LedgerMaster` (where customer) | **🔗 Customer Master page** | Triggers AJAX cascade |
| `Contact_Person` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | ← `LM_Contact_Person` from customer | **🔗 Customer Master** | Filled when customer selected |
| `Contact_No` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | ← `LM_Phone_Number` from customer | **🔗 Customer Master** | Filled when customer selected |
| `LM_Address1–5` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | ← address from customer | **🔗 Customer Master** | 5 fields filled from customer record |
| `GSTTIN` | **🔄 AJAX Auto-filled** | ← `LM_GSTIN` from customer | **🔗 Customer Master** | Filled when customer selected |
| `CustomerRefNo` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `Revision_No` | **Manual** / **Auto** | — | — | Increments on edit |
| `Delivery_Date` | **Manual** | — | — | Date picker |
| `Validity_Until` | **Manual** | — | — | Text input |
| `QuotationTypeId` | **Dropdown** | `QuotationTypeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Quotation Type" | Reference Group derived |
| `GradeId` | **Dropdown** | `QuotationGradeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Grade/Model" | Reference Group derived |
| `TaxTypeId` | **Dropdown** | `QuotationTaxTypeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Tax Type" | Determines SGST/CGST vs IGST split |
| `TaxId` | **Dropdown** | Tax percentage list from `Tax_Master` | **🔗 Tax Master page** (`/TaxMaster/Create`) | Shows configured tax slabs |
| `CurrencyTypeId` | **Dropdown** | `QuotationCurrencyTypeMaster` | **🔗 Ref Group Value page** — Group: "Currency Type" | Reference Group derived |
| `Exchange_Rate` | **Manual** | — | — | Decimal input |
| `Payment_Terms` | **🔄 Auto-filled** + **Editable** | `TermsCondition` table (where `Status='A'` and `Type_ID=1021`) | **🔗 No UI** — Pre-loaded DB data | Pre-filled from database on form load, user can edit |
| `PdfFile` | **File Upload** | — | — | Saved to filesystem |

### Quotation Line Items

| Field | Input Method | Data Source | Managed On Page | Relationship |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `Item_ID` | **Popup Lookup** | `ItemMaster` table | **🔗 Item Master page** (`/ItemMaster/Create`) | User searches items via popup: `GET /Quotation/ListJson?search=&groupId=` |
| `Item_Code` | **🔄 Auto-filled** from item | ← `IM_Part_No` | **🔗 Item Master** | Part number |
| `Item_Name` | **🔄 Auto-filled** from item | ← `IM_PartName` | **🔗 Item Master** | Part name |
| `Description` | **🔄 Auto-filled** from item | ← `IM_Description` | **🔗 Item Master** | Description |
| `HSN_Code` | **🔄 Auto-filled** from item | ← `IM_HSN_Code` | **🔗 Item Master** | HSN code |
| `UOM` | **🔄 Auto-filled** from item | ← `IM_UOM` from UnitMaster | **🔗 Item Master → Ref Group** | Unit of measurement |
| `Qty` | **Manual** | — | — | Decimal input |
| `Unit_Price` | **Manual** or **🔄 Auto-filled** | ← `IM_Purchase_Rate` from item | **🔗 Item Master** | Can use item rate or override |
| `Disc_Per` | **Manual** | — | — | Discount percentage |
| `Desc_Amt` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Unit_Price × Disc_Per / 100` | — | Auto-calculated on input (see §17.8) |
| `Final_Price` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Unit_Price - Desc_Amt` | — | Auto-calculated (see §17.8) |
| `Sub_total` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Qty × Final_Price` | — | Auto-calculated (see §17.8) |
| `GST_Per` | **🔄 Auto-filled** | From selected `TaxId` header → `Tax_Master.TM_Tax_Percent` | **🔗 Tax Master** | Applied from header tax selection |
| `SGST_Per` / `CGST_Per` | **🔄 Calculated** | `GST_Per / 2` (if local via TaxTypeId) | — | Split: half SGST + half CGST for local (see §17.8) |
| `IGST_Per` | **🔄 Calculated** | `= GST_Per` (if interstate via TaxTypeId) | — | Full IGST for interstate (see §17.8) |
| `GST_Amt` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Sub_total × GST_Per / 100` | — | Tax amount (see §17.8) |
| `Net_Amt` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Sub_total + GST_Amt` | — | Line total (see §17.8) |
| `Currency` | **🔄 Auto-filled** | From `CurrencyTypeId` header | **🔗 Ref Group** | Currency code |
| `Exchange_Rate_Price` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Unit_Price / Exchange_Rate` | — | Auto-calculated (see §17.8) |

### Quotation Summary (Footer Calculations)

| Field | Input Method | Formula | Relationship |
|---|---|---|---|
| `Total_Before_Disc` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Σ(all line Sub_total)` | — |
| `Sdiscount` | **Manual** | — | Flat discount input |
| `Desc_Per` | **Manual** | — | Discount percentage |
| `Desc_Amt` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Total_Before_Disc × Desc_Per / 100` | — |
| `Freight_Amount` | **Manual** | — | Shipping/freight input |
| `Packing_Forward` | **Manual** | — | Packing charges input |
| `Taxable_Amount` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Total - Discount + Freight + Packing` | — |
| `MIGST_Amt` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Taxable_Amount × IGST_Per / 100` | — |
| `MSGST_Amt` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Taxable_Amount × SGST_Per / 100` | — |
| `MCGST_Amt` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Taxable_Amount × CGST_Per / 100` | — |
| `GrandTotal` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Taxable_Amount + All Tax Amounts` | — |
| `RoundOff` | **🔄 Calculated** | `Round(GrandTotal) - GrandTotal` | — |
| `Net_Amt` | **🔄 Calculated** | `GrandTotal + RoundOff` | Final amount |

