### 17.7 System-Captured Timestamp & User Fields

These are set by C# code in the repository layer on every CRUD operation:

| Operation | Field Set | C# Code |
|---|---|---|
| **Create** | `CreatedDate` / `IM_CreatedDate` / `RGV_dCreatedDate` / `Created_Date` | `entity.CreatedDate = DateTime.Now;` |
| **Update** | `UpdatedDate` / `Updated_Date` / `RGV_dUpdateDate` | `entity.UpdatedDate = DateTime.Now;` |
| **Delete** (soft) | `Deleted_Date` / `RGV_dDeletedDate` | `entity.Deleted_Date = DateTime.Now;` |
| **Undelete** | `UnDeleted_Date` | `entity.UnDeleted_Date = DateTime.Now;` |
| **Create** | `CreatedBy` / `LM_Createdby` / `Created_By` | From `Session["UserID"]` or `SystemInfo.USERNAME` by IP |
| **Update** | `UpdatedBy` / `Updated_By` / `LM_Updated_by` | From `Session["UserID"]` or `SystemInfo.USERNAME` by IP |

#### Audit Trail Pattern (applied on every Create/Edit/Delete):
```csharp
string IpAddress = Request.UserHostAddress;

var macAddress = _context.SystemInfo
    .Where(item => item.IPAddress == IpAddress)
    .OrderByDescending(item => item.ID)
    .Select(item => item.MACAddress)
    .FirstOrDefault();

var deviceName = _context.SystemInfo
    .Where(item => item.IPAddress == IpAddress)
    .OrderByDescending(item => item.ID)
    .Select(item => item.DeviceName)
    .FirstOrDefault();

var userName = _context.SystemInfo
    .Where(item => item.IPAddress == IpAddress)
    .OrderByDescending(item => item.ID)
    .Select(item => item.USERNAME)
    .FirstOrDefault();

// Create fields:  IPAddress, MACAddress, DeviceName, Created_By
// Update fields:  UIPAddress, UMACAddress, UDeviceName, Updated_By
// Delete fields:  DIPAddress, DMACAddress, DDeviceName, Deleted_by
```

---

### 17.8 Client-Side Calculated Fields (Quotation JavaScript)

The Quotation line item calculations are performed by JavaScript on the client when user changes `Qty`, `Discount`, or `GST` values:

```javascript
// Triggered on: input change of .qty, .discount, .gst
var unitPrice   = parseFloat(row.find('td:eq(2)').text());
var qty         = parseFloat(row.find('.qty').val()) || 0;
var discountPer = parseFloat(row.find('.discount').val()) || 0;
var gstPer      = parseFloat(row.find('.gst').val()) || 0;

// Line item formulas:
var discountAmt = (unitPrice * qty) * (discountPer / 100);
var gstAmt      = ((unitPrice * qty) - discountAmt) * (gstPer / 100);
var rowTotal    = (unitPrice * qty) - discountAmt + gstAmt;
```

#### Complete Calculation Chain:

```
                          ┌─── Manual ──────────── Unit_Price
                          ├─── Manual ──────────── Qty
                          ├─── Manual ──────────── Disc_Per
                          │
Desc_Amt ─────────────────┤  Formula: Unit_Price × Qty × Disc_Per / 100
                          │
Final_Price ──────────────┤  Formula: Unit_Price - (Desc_Amt / Qty)
                          │
Sub_total ────────────────┤  Formula: Qty × Final_Price
                          │      OR:  (Unit_Price × Qty) - Desc_Amt
                          │
        ┌─ If Local ──────┤  SGST_Per = GST_Per / 2
        │                 │  CGST_Per = GST_Per / 2
        │                 │  IGST_Per = 0
GST ────┤
        │                 │
        └─ If Interstate ─┤  IGST_Per = GST_Per
                          │  SGST_Per = 0
                          │  CGST_Per = 0
                          │
GST_Amt ──────────────────┤  Formula: Sub_total × GST_Per / 100
                          │
Net_Amt (line) ───────────┤  Formula: Sub_total + GST_Amt
                          │
Exchange_Rate_Price ──────┤  Formula: Unit_Price / Exchange_Rate


========== FOOTER (Summary Totals) ==========

Total_Before_Disc ────────┤  Formula: Σ(line Sub_total)
                          │
Desc_Amt (footer) ────────┤  Formula: Total_Before_Disc × Desc_Per / 100
                          │      OR:  = Sdiscount (flat amount)
                          │
Taxable_Amount ───────────┤  Formula: Total - Disc + Freight + Packing
                          │
MIGST_Amt ────────────────┤  Formula: Taxable_Amount × IGST_Per / 100
MSGST_Amt ────────────────┤  Formula: Taxable_Amount × SGST_Per / 100
MCGST_Amt ────────────────┤  Formula: Taxable_Amount × CGST_Per / 100
                          │
GrandTotal ───────────────┤  Formula: Taxable + All Taxes
                          │
RoundOff ─────────────────┤  Formula: Round(Grand) - Grand
                          │
Net_Amt (final) ──────────┤  Formula: Grand + RoundOff
```

#### Server-Side Totals Calculation (`CalculateTotals` endpoint):
```csharp
[HttpPost]
public JsonResult CalculateTotals(List<OrderItemViewModel> items)
{
    decimal totalPrice = 0;
    decimal totalSGSTAmt = 0, totalCGSTAmt = 0;
    decimal totalGSTAmt = 0, totalIGSTAmt = 0;
    decimal totalCurrencyValue = 0;
    foreach (var item in items)
    {
        totalPrice += item.Sub_total;
        totalSGSTAmt += item.SGST_Amt;
        totalCGSTAmt += item.CGST_Amt;
        totalGSTAmt += item.GST_Amt;
        totalIGSTAmt += item.IGST_Amt;
        totalCurrencyValue += item.Currency_Rate_Total;
    }
    return Json(new {
        Total_Before_GST = totalPrice.ToString("0.00"),
        Sub_total_before_dis = totalPrice.ToString("0.00"),
        Total_Currency = totalCurrencyValue.ToString("0.00"),
    });
}
```

