### 17.9 Auto-Update Summary Table

| Field | Page | Update Type | When | Formula / Source |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| `CompanyCode` | Company Master | 🔄 Auto-generated | Form load | SP: `Pr_Fetch_Company_Code` |
| `RGV_vCode` | Ref Group Value | 🔄 Auto-generated | On group select | SP: `Pr_Fetch_RGV_vCode @id` |
| `IM_Part_No` | Item Master | 🔄 Auto-generated | On save | SQL fn: `Z_GetMaximumPartNumberPlusOne1NEW1(@group)` |
| `Outsource_Part_No` | Item Master | 🔄 Auto-generated | On save | `"VOS" + MAX(MAXOSPN)` from view |
| `Serial_No` | Vehicle Master | 🔄 Auto-generated | On model select | `MAX(SNoPartNumber)+1` within financial year |
| `PO_No` | Quotation | 🔄 Auto-generated | Form load | `FY/Q` + padded MAX+1 |
| `Customer_Code` | Vehicle Master | 🔄 AJAX Auto-fill | On customer select | `LedgerMaster.LM_Code` |
| `LM_Address1-5` | Vehicle/Quotation | 🔄 AJAX Auto-fill | On customer select | `LedgerMaster.LM_Address1-5` |
| `LM_StateCode` | Customer Master | 🔄 AJAX Auto-fill | On state autocomplete | `StateMaster.StateCode` (via `value`) |
| `Contact_Person` | Quotation | 🔄 AJAX Auto-fill | On customer select | `LedgerMaster.LM_Contact_Person` |
| `Contact_No` | Quotation | 🔄 AJAX Auto-fill | On customer select | `LedgerMaster.LM_Phone_Number` |
| `GSTTIN` | Quotation | 🔄 AJAX Auto-fill | On customer select | `LedgerMaster.LM_GSTIN` |
| `Vehicle_Count` | Vehicle Master | 🔄 AJAX Auto-fill | On customer select | `MAX(Customer_Vehicle_Count)` |
| `Machine_Name` | Process Master | 🔄 Auto-filled | On machine select | `MachineMaster.Machine_Name` |
| `Item_Code/Name/Desc` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Auto-filled | On item select | `ItemMaster` fields |
| `GST_Per` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Auto-filled | On item select | `ItemMaster.IM_GST_Per` |
| `SGST_Per/CGST_Per` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Calculated | On item select | `GST_Per / 2` (Local) |
| `IGST_Per` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Calculated | On item select | `= GST_Per` (Interstate) |
| `Desc_Amt` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Unit_Price × Qty × Disc_Per / 100` |
| `Final_Price` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Unit_Price - Desc_Amt` |
| `Sub_total` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Qty × Final_Price` |
| `GST_Amt` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Sub_total × GST_Per / 100` |
| `Net_Amt` (line) | Quotation lines | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Sub_total + GST_Amt` |
| `Exchange_Rate_Price` | Quotation lines | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Unit_Price / Exchange_Rate` |
| `Total_Before_Disc` | Quotation footer | 🔄 Calculated | On grid change | `Σ(line Sub_total)` |
| `Taxable_Amount` | Quotation footer | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Total - Disc + Freight + Packing` |
| `MIGST/MSGST/MCGST_Amt` | Quotation footer | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Taxable_Amount × Rate / 100` |
| `GrandTotal` | Quotation footer | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Taxable + All Taxes` |
| `RoundOff` | Quotation footer | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Round(Grand) - Grand` |
| `Net_Amt` (final) | Quotation footer | 🔄 Calculated | On input change | `Grand + RoundOff` |
| `Payment_Terms` | Quotation | 🔄 Pre-filled | Form load | `TermsCondition` where `Status=A, Type_ID=1021` |
| `CreatedDate` | ALL pages | 🔄 System-captured | On save | `DateTime.Now` |
| `IPAddress` | ALL pages | 🔄 System-captured | On save | `Request.UserHostAddress` |
| `MACAddress` | ALL pages | 🔄 System-captured | On save | `SystemInfo.Where(IP).Select(MAC)` |
| `DeviceName` | ALL pages | 🔄 System-captured | On save | `SystemInfo.Where(IP).Select(Device)` |
| `Created_By` | ALL pages | 🔄 System-captured | On save | `SystemInfo.Where(IP).Select(USERNAME)` |

---

> **Summary**: The Reference Group Value page is the **central hub** — it feeds dropdown values to 10+ master pages through SQL views. The System Info Master page is the **audit hub** — it provides device/user information for every CRUD operation system-wide. Tax Master feeds both Item Master and Quotation. Customer Master feeds both Vehicle Master and Quotation via AJAX auto-fill cascades. All auto-generated codes use either **stored procedures** (Company Code, RGV Code) or **SQL functions/queries** (Part Numbers, Serial Numbers, Quotation Numbers), while all calculated fields use **client-side JavaScript** with server-side validation.
